## Title: |cff0091edNaowh|r|cffffa300UI|r_SmartReminders |cff8a99b5[test 0830c]|r
## Notes: Calls out what to press when the boss timeline says an ability is coming. All specs.
## Author: NaowhUI
## Version: 1.1.0-test-0830c
## OptionalDeps: NaowhUI_Media, BigWigs, DBM-Core
## SavedVariables: NaowhUI_SmartRemindersDB
## Group: NaowhUI
## IconTexture: Interface\AddOns\NaowhUI_SmartReminders\Media\icon.tga
## AddonCompartmentFunc: NaowhUI_SmartReminders_OnCompartmentClick

Libs\embeds.xml

# Core first: theme, chrome primitives, the DB and profiles -- everything later files
# hang off.
NaowhUI_SmartReminders_Core.lua

# The widget kit: ns.UI, the shim every options page calls in place of EllesmereUI's
# factory. Needs ns.THEME and the Core primitives.
NaowhUI_SmartReminders_Widgets.lua

# The standalone options window: tabs, scroll, RefreshPage, slash/compartment entry.
# The page builders it dispatches to live in the later files, resolved at open time.
NaowhUI_SmartReminders_Window.lua

# Tank busters Blizzard's own TankRole bit does not carry. Additive to it, never a
# replacement, so content this file has never heard of still works unchanged. Loads after
# Core, which owns the namespace it hangs off.
NaowhUI_SmartReminders_Abilities.lua

NaowhUI_SmartReminders.lua

# Raid-wide external/CD reminders, assignable to a role/class/spec/name/subgroup rather
# than the local player only -- built on the same BigWigs/DBM bar bridge the main file
# already runs for tank busters (ns.ScheduleBWFire), not a second one. Loads after the
# main file, which owns that bridge and the per-boss-set helper this hangs off.
NaowhUI_SmartReminders_RaidReminders.lua

# Shareable Reminder Packs: a curator's lists, priorities and written reminders as
# one string, with preview-before-apply. Loads after the runtime it packages.
NaowhUI_SmartReminders_Packs.lua

# Reads this season's bosses and their tank-flagged abilities out of the player's own
# Dungeon Journal. Lazy: nothing is read until the page is opened.
NaowhUI_SmartReminders_Bosses.lua
